    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story Background</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u300a\u5de5\u5ec8 Warehouse\u300b</strong> is a short first-person action psychological horror game set inside a rotting Hong Kong industrial building. You\u2019re the landlord. You came to deliver rent notices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But somewhere between the fifth and seventh floor\u2026 something changes. The walls shift. The tenants get quiet. And the building starts remembering things it shouldn\u2019t.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656990/extras/0f8acbe8d9ee16124b11e6652dd1459f.avif?t=1752740261\" data-has-big width=800 height=404 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First-Person Psychological Horror</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A focused 60-minute descent into tension, paranoia, and guilt. No filler. Just fear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656990/extras/17d22eda6beffb1b284b150e8c59500d.poster.avif?t=1752740261\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656990/extras/17d22eda6beffb1b284b150e8c59500d.webm?t=1752740261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656990/extras/17d22eda6beffb1b284b150e8c59500d.mp4?t=1752740261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VHS-Style Camera View</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through the flicker of a VHS lens, nothing looks quite right.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656990/extras/a71efc2ab530d57da8d331633588d98a.poster.avif?t=1752740261\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656990/extras/a71efc2ab530d57da8d331633588d98a.webm?t=1752740261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656990/extras/a71efc2ab530d57da8d331633588d98a.mp4?t=1752740261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escape room horror, room by room</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each floor is a self-contained nightmare. Search for clues. Solve the puzzle. Open the next door.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656990/extras/4ac1393a6de1de27d08ad7be6306faf1.poster.avif?t=1752740261\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656990/extras/4ac1393a6de1de27d08ad7be6306faf1.webm?t=1752740261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656990/extras/4ac1393a6de1de27d08ad7be6306faf1.mp4?t=1752740261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gun in Hand, But Never in Control</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have a gun. So what? It won\u2019t stop the things here. It might just make them angrier.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656990/extras/711aee8c02556fbfa7dc2dc1344a0284.poster.avif?t=1752740261\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656990/extras/711aee8c02556fbfa7dc2dc1344a0284.webm?t=1752740261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656990/extras/711aee8c02556fbfa7dc2dc1344a0284.mp4?t=1752740261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story Background</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u300a\u5de5\u5ec8 Warehouse\u300b</strong> is a short first-person action psychological horror game set inside a rotting Hong Kong industrial building. You\u2019re the landlord. You came to deliver rent notices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But somewhere between the fifth and seventh floor\u2026 something changes. The walls shift. The tenants get quiet. And the building starts remembering things it shouldn\u2019t.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656990/extras/0f8acbe8d9ee16124b11e6652dd1459f.avif?t=1752740261\" data-has-big width=800 height=404 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First-Person Psychological Horror</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A focused 60-minute descent into tension, paranoia, and guilt. No filler. Just fear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656990/extras/17d22eda6beffb1b284b150e8c59500d.poster.avif?t=1752740261\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656990/extras/17d22eda6beffb1b284b150e8c59500d.webm?t=1752740261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656990/extras/17d22eda6beffb1b284b150e8c59500d.mp4?t=1752740261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VHS-Style Camera View</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through the flicker of a VHS lens, nothing looks quite right.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656990/extras/a71efc2ab530d57da8d331633588d98a.poster.avif?t=1752740261\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656990/extras/a71efc2ab530d57da8d331633588d98a.webm?t=1752740261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656990/extras/a71efc2ab530d57da8d331633588d98a.mp4?t=1752740261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escape room horror, room by room</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each floor is a self-contained nightmare. Search for clues. Solve the puzzle. Open the next door.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656990/extras/4ac1393a6de1de27d08ad7be6306faf1.poster.avif?t=1752740261\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656990/extras/4ac1393a6de1de27d08ad7be6306faf1.webm?t=1752740261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656990/extras/4ac1393a6de1de27d08ad7be6306faf1.mp4?t=1752740261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gun in Hand, But Never in Control</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have a gun. So what? It won\u2019t stop the things here. It might just make them angrier.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656990/extras/711aee8c02556fbfa7dc2dc1344a0284.poster.avif?t=1752740261\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656990/extras/711aee8c02556fbfa7dc2dc1344a0284.webm?t=1752740261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656990/extras/711aee8c02556fbfa7dc2dc1344a0284.mp4?t=1752740261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "\u5de5\u5ec8 Warehouse is a short action psychological horror game, developed by a solo developer, set in a decaying Hong Kong industrial building. Armed with a VHS camcorder and a handgun, uncover buried guilt and survive the horrors that lurk in the dark as past sins claw their way into the present.",
